[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Roast Beef and Potatoes]
[00:00.68]Lesson 81 | 第81课
[00:02.42]Roast beef and potatoes | 烤牛肉和土豆
[00:06.27]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.89]Why is Carol disappointed? | 卡罗尔为什么感到失望？
[00:16.12]Hi, Carol! Where's Tom? | 嗨，卡罗尔！汤姆在哪儿？
[00:20.00]He's upstairs. | 他在楼上。
[00:22.40]He's having a bath. | 他正在洗澡。
[00:24.72]Tom! | 汤姆！
[00:26.54]Yes? | 怎么了？
[00:27.91]Sam's here. | 山姆来了。
[00:29.82]I'm nearly ready. | 我快好了。
[00:31.89]Hello, Sam. | 你好，山姆。
[00:34.52]Have a cigarette. | 来根烟吧。
[00:36.56]No, thanks, Tom. | 不了，谢谢你，汤姆。
[00:38.78]Have a glass of whisky then. | 那来杯威士忌吧。
[00:41.67]OK. | 好的。
[00:42.61]Thanks. | 谢谢。
[00:43.76]Is dinner ready, Carol? | 晚饭准备好了吗，卡罗尔？
[00:47.00]It's nearly ready. | 差不多好了。
[00:49.67]We can have dinner at seven o'clock. | 我们七点可以吃晚饭。
[00:54.22]Sam and I had lunch together today. | 山姆和我今天一起吃了午饭。
[00:58.36]We went to a restaurant. | 我们去了一家餐馆。
[01:00.95]What did you have? | 你们吃了什么？
[01:03.03]We had roast beef and potatoes. | 我们吃了烤牛肉和土豆。
[01:06.83]Oh! | 哦！
[01:08.45]What's the matter, Carol? | 怎么了，卡罗尔？
[01:10.86]Well, you're going to have roast beef and potatoes again tonight! | 呃，你们今晚又要吃烤牛肉和土豆了！